# powerkill: recorded by the port from this script (no cheats, so format 4, which DOS
# replays), from the saved game setup/headless writes; its golden is DOS's replay of that
# recording. "Journey Onward" and slot I (the player facing the powerful headless, 162
# experience, at (46,60) on level 6); F5, and the right button held 0.9 s in the middle of the
# view every 1.5 s, 25 times, which kills it. player_killed_a gives 162 * 4 + 2d162 = 919, and
# for a powerful critter that times 24 to 47 (here 39) over 16, which in 16 bits is 919 * 39 =
# 35841, -29695 in DOS, so -1855: the kill takes experience away, where the port before its
# fix gave 2240
